**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
**/overlays/*/.env-*
!**/overlays/*/.env-*.example

# Terraform state and local variable files are never needed in image builds.
**/.terraform
**/.terraform/**
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example
**/terraform.tfvars
**/terraform.tfvars.json

# Private keys, certificates, and local credentials.
**/*private-key*
**/*private_key*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.crt
**/*.cer
**/*credentials*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/application_default_credentials.json

# Local tooling caches and build outputs.
.git
.git/**
.boss
.boss/**
.worktrees
.worktrees/**
node_modules
node_modules/**
bin
bin/**
*.log
